Object model data
-----------------

The resource types come from github.com/cB-Sigma/lwm2m, whose built-in
object model holds facts from the OMNA LwM2M registry (BSD-3-Clause,
Copyright Open Mobile Alliance); that module's NOTICE carries the
registry's licence text.

