Interop tests (interop/, a separate test-only module)
-----------------------------------------------------

interop/peer/Dockerfile downloads Eclipse Leshan's demo server, demo
bootstrap server and demo client 2.0.0-M18 (Eclipse Public License 2.0
or Eclipse Distribution License 1.0, Copyright the Leshan contributors)
from Maven Central into an eclipse-temurin:21-jre-alpine image at test
time; nothing of Leshan is copied into this repository. The tests talk
to the demo server's REST API, whose request shapes were read from its
published sources (facts only).

Test data
---------

Every endpoint name, value, key and address in this module is a made-up
demo value.
